Z||000000||tgowens||04-21-2001||02:47 PM||||There seems to be an individual on here who is taking great delight in using the public forum to further his cause to continue a feud with another poster here (the identities of these individuals probably are not a surprise to any of you) - but, for some reason he wants to involve me in his sordid little game and for the life of me I cannot understand why -- I have no control over the individual who is the object of his feud and therefore cannot understand why he is taking the shots at me (other than the fact that I am more visible on here because of posting more than his target)<P>Now, many of you know me and I think most will attest to the fact that if I say it I do it....that is integrity and I have lived my life with that value. I don't take delight in stabbing or taking shots at others as it is highly demaning and abusive. It's just not the way I choose to live my life.<P>I sincerely hope that this individual get this all sorted out and tires of this little game so that we can all resume our lives without having to endure what is one man's feud with another. -- To my knowledge, those two have never faced each other and tried to work out their differences - if they aren't going to take that step I think they (or he) should let it go and get on with life - there is more to life than sitting at a computer trying to stir up trouble for others.<P>But, I guess it takes all kinds to make the world go around. As for me, I strive to keep from offending anyone and sincerely try to accomplish everything that I set out to do. If I <I>have</I> offended anyone here, I am deeply sorry that I did - believe me, it was entirely unintentional.||||reg||1
